  "timeout_sec": 30,
  "hints": [
    {
      "tr": "Anahtar `lambda r: (-r[1], r[0])`: önce puanın eksisi (büyük puan önde), eşitse ad.",
      "en": "The key is `lambda r: (-r[1], r[0])`: the negative score first (high scores first), then the name if equal."
    },
    {
      "tr": "Sıralanmış listeden adları `[r[0] for r in ordered]` ile al.",
      "en": "Take the names from the sorted list with `[r[0] for r in ordered]`."
    },
    {
      "tr": "Çözümün tamamı:\n\n```python\ndef rank(records):\n    ordered = sorted(records, key=lambda r: (-r[1], r[0]))\n    return [r[0] for r in ordered]\n\n\nprint(rank([[\"Cem\", 80], [\"Ada\", 92], [\"Bora\", 80]]))\nprint(rank([[\"Zeki\", 70], [\"Mert\", 70], [\"Lale\", 70]]))\n```",
      "en": "The full solution:\n\n```python\ndef rank(records):\n    ordered = sorted(records, key=lambda r: (-r[1], r[0]))\n    return [r[0] for r in ordered]\n\n\nprint(rank([[\"Cem\", 80], [\"Ada\", 92], [\"Bora\", 80]]))\nprint(rank([[\"Zeki\", 70], [\"Mert\", 70], [\"Lale\", 70]]))\n```"
    }
  ],
